      "target": "../sections/sec-front-matter.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Pandemic influenza\npreparedness Framework \nfor the sharing of influenza viruses \nand access to vaccines and \nother benefits\nPandemic influenza\npreparedness Framework \nfor the sharing of influenza viruses \nand access to vaccines and \nother benefits\nii\n© World Health Organization 2011\nAll rights reserved. Publications of the World Health Organization are available on the WHO \nweb site (www.who.int) or can be purchased from WHO Press, World Health Organization, \n20 Avenue Appia, 1211 Geneva 27, Switzerland (tel.: +41 22 791 3264; fax: +41 22 791 4857; e-mail: \nbookorders@who.int). Requests for pe",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The front matter of WHO's 2011 Pandemic Influenza Preparedness Framework for the sharing of influenza viruses and access to vaccines and other benefits. It contains the title and copyright pages and contents, and begins World Health Assembly resolution WHA64.5 of 24 May 2011, which considered the report of the Open-Ended Working Group of Member States.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
